@base = http://localhost:5114
@alice = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@bob = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### Without a tenant: 400 (the request does not reach the business code)
GET {{base}}/accounts

### The same URL at three banks: Alice has 1,000 €, 3,000 € or 25,000 €
GET {{base}}/accounts/{{alice}}
X-Tenant: alpha

###
GET {{base}}/accounts/{{alice}}
X-Tenant: beta

###
GET {{base}}/accounts/{{alice}}
X-Tenant: gamma

### The tenant can also come from the subdomain (*.localhost points to the local machine)
GET http://beta.localhost:5114/tenant

### Contradictory subdomain and header: 400, we don't pick one
GET http://beta.localhost:5114/accounts
X-Tenant: alpha

### Transfer of 1,500 € at Alpha: refused (limit 1,000 €)
POST {{base}}/transfers
X-Tenant: alpha
Content-Type: application/json

{ "source": "{{alice}}", "target": "{{bob}}", "amount": 1500 }

### The same at Beta: accepted, with 0.50 € of fees
POST {{base}}/transfers
X-Tenant: beta
Content-Type: application/json

{ "source": "{{alice}}", "target": "{{bob}}", "amount": 1500 }

### Open an account at Alpha (quota: 5 accounts)
POST {{base}}/accounts
X-Tenant: alpha
Content-Type: application/json

{ "owner": "Zoe", "initialDeposit": 100 }

### ─── Platform back office (without a tenant) ───

### The tenants: plan, isolation, database, rules, quotas
GET {{base}}/platform/tenants

### The content of each database: Alpha and Beta share a database, Gamma has its own
GET {{base}}/platform/storage

### Register a new customer: usable immediately (X-Tenant: delta)
POST {{base}}/platform/tenants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "delta",
  "name": "Bank Delta",
  "plan": "Standard",
  "rules": { "transferLimit": 2000, "transferFee": 1, "monthlyFee": 0, "maxAccounts": 50 }
}

### Alpha moves to Premium: its data moves to a dedicated database (see /platform/storage)
POST {{base}}/platform/tenants/alpha/plan
Content-Type: application/json

{ "plan": "Premium" }

### Suspend Beta: its requests answer 403, the other banks see nothing
POST {{base}}/platform/tenants/beta/suspend

###
POST {{base}}/platform/tenants/beta/reactivate

### Background task: account keeping fees, at each bank's rate (replaying the same month has no effect)
POST {{base}}/platform/tasks/monthly-fees
Content-Type: application/json

{ "month": "2026-10" }

### A customer leaves: all its data is erased, and only its data
DELETE {{base}}/platform/tenants/beta
